# The repository root ignores `outputs/` and `logs/` generically (safety net for
# the other sub-projects). This project deliberately tracks its small result
# JSONs and run logs, so re-include them here — while still refusing binaries.

!outputs/
!outputs/**
!logs/
!logs/**

# never track these
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.npz
*.npy
data/
